-radius: 4px;\">#{{ $('Execute Workflow Trigger').first().json.case_id }}</code></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Client Full Name:</td><td><strong style=\"color: #0f172a;\">{{ $('Execute Workflow Trigger').first().json.client_name || 'Valued Client' }}</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Registered Email:</td><td><a href=\"mailto:{{ $('Execute Workflow Trigger').first().json.client_email }}\" style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;\">{{ $('Execute Workflow Trigger').first().json.client_email }}</a></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Onboarding Status:</td><td><span style=\"background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">✅ Registered &amp; Active</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Initial Legal Stage:</td><td><span style=\"color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600;\">Paper Filed / Pleading Preparation</span></td></tr></table></div><div style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 22px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #15803d; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">📋 What Happens Next:</h4><ol style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #166534; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">Our administration and legal research team will finalize initial docketing and review.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">A dedicated legal advocate will be assigned to represent your matter in court.</li><li>You will receive automated real-time notifications for every court date, hearing schedule, and milestone update.</li></ol></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 26px 0 18px 0;\"><a href=\"{{ $vars.CLIENT_PORTAL_URL }}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #1a73e8; color: #ffffff; padding: 13px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(26,115,232,0.3);\">📱 Access Client Portal &amp; View Case ➔</a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0 16px 0;\"/><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Legal Practice Management System &bull; Privileged &amp; Confidential Attorney-Client Communication</p></div></div>"
